★ Company Profile Design.\r\n★ 3D Signboard Design.\r\n★ Company Profile Design.\r\n★ Sticker Printing.\r\n★ Banner Printing.\r\n★ Printing on Wooden Awards.\r\n★ T-shirt printing & Embroidery.\r\n★ Mug Printing.\r\n★ Pen Printing.\r\n★ Crystal, Medals.\r\n★ Roll up stand design & printing.\r\n★ Bill book design & printing.\r\n★ Restaurant menu design & printing.','https://backend-v2.aram-gulf.com/images/offers/WhatsApp Image 2026-01-10 at 12.35.00 PM_69620fb1d9117.jpeg',0,NULL,'percentage',5.00,'NA14HWOZ','2026-01-10','2027-01-10','active',422,99,'2026-01-10 08:37:05','2026-01-10 08:37:05'),(26,'Barber services','Hair cut \r\nShave \r\nFacial massage','https://backend-v2.aram-gulf.com/images/offers/1000201778_6964e923b2fcf.jpg',0,NULL,'percentage',5.00,'O3XC1JYN','2026-01-12','2027-01-12','active',423,26,'2026-01-12 12:29:23','2026-01-12 12:29:23');
